OL,3,ANvidia says it won't reinstate Huang as
OL,4,Ait reports soaring sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia has firmly ruled out letting
OL,7,Fousted co-founder Jensen Huang return
OL,8,Fas it revealed that sales doubled to
OL,9,Fmore than $100bn.
OL,11,FIn the company's first results since
OL,12,FHuang's dramatic exit last week,
OL,13,Finterim chief executive Colette Kress
OL,14,Fsaid it was "business as usual" and
OL,15,Ftold investors: "We've got this."
OL,17,FEarlier on Tuesday, Huang said he would
OL,18,Fbe "honoured" to return and lead
OL,19,FNvidia, having quit following alleged
OL,20,Fextramarital affairs, including one
OL,21,Fwith a suspected spy for China.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,110,105,200,160,0,100
